      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Shard's Landing [zone=867]\n**Who:**\n- Tomekeeper Kerkaz [ _Spell Runes_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Glowing Terrormote [item=106845]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 10:59:40 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_Find Tomekeeper Kerkaz in Shard's Landing. He's at /location 435, 25, 0 (in a tent in the southwestern portion of the crater, slightly north of the quest NPC camp)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tomekeeper Kerkaz'\nTomekeeper Kerkaz says 'Who dares disturb my... oh, forget it. What do you want? Have you made yourself useful and found a [Dreadmote] or [Terrormote] for me, or did you simply want to [chat]?'\nYou say, 'Let's chat...'\nTomekeeper Kerkaz says 'Oh, wonderful. How has your day been? What brings you to the area? Are you sightseeing, perhaps? Or are you attempting to heal the very fabric of our existence and bring the Pantheon back in to balance? That's what I am here to do.'\nYou say, 'I have a Terrormote'\nTomekeeper Kerkaz says 'Fear can not be contained in one simple emotion. Terror, for instance, is the simplest way to determine the true nature of any being. Who would you abandon in a moment of terror? Who would you kill?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Glowing Terrormote'.\nTomekeeper Kerkaz in Shard's Landing has asked you to return any Dreadmotes you find as a reward.\n\n---\n\nDeliver 1 Glowing Terrormote to Tomekeeper Kerkaz 0/1 (Shard's Landing)\n_Terrormotes drop from raids in the Rain of Fear expansion._\n\n---\n\n**Spell Reward Sets**\n**If you have information about your class's reward sets, please post below.**\n**If you'd like to help get spell scrolls into the database faster, download the item collector and run it in the background as you play EQ. Thank you!!**\n_NOTE: Each line listed below represents one reward; some spells are rewarded together._\nBard\nSong: Arcane Hymn Rk. III; Wave of Quietude Rk. III\nSong: Aura of Va'Ker Rk. III; Song: Echo of Va'Ker Rk. III\nSong: Kaficus' Spiteful Lyric Rk. III; Song: Motlak's Lively Crescendo Rk. III\nSong: Gosik's Chant of Flame Rk. III\nSong: Kaficus' Insult Rk. III\nTome: Reflexive Retort Rk. III (Shadow of Fear)\nBeastlord\nScroll: Shared Merciless Ferocity Rk. III\nTome: Pummel Rk. III\nScroll: Yell at the Moon Rk. III\nScroll: Spellbreaker's Ward Rk. III\nScroll: Kesar's Feralgia Rk. III\nTome: Reflexive Rending Rk. III; Scroll: Nak's Maelstrom Rk. III (Shadow of Fear)\nBerserker\nTome: Brutal Discipline Rk. III\nTome: Fearless Frenzy Rk. III\nTome: Shared Viciousness Rk. III\nTome: Axe of Zurel Rk. III (Shadow of Fear)\nCleric\nScroll: Armor of the Reverent Rk. III, Scroll: Olsif's Retort Rk. III\nScroll: Unified Hand of Gezat Rk. III, Scroll: Elixir of the Acquittal Rk. III\nScroll: Fraught Renewal Rk. III, Scroll: Unified Hand of Certitude Rk. III\nScroll: Reforming Splash Rk. III, Scroll: Rallied Bastion of Vie Rk. III\nScroll: Virtuous Contravention Rk. III, Scroll: Word of Reformation Rk. III\nScroll: Aura of the Reverent Rk. III (Shadow of Fear)\nDruid\nScroll: Legacy of Spikethistles Rk. III, Scroll: Chill of the Visionary Rk. III\nScroll: Granitebark Blessing Rk. III, Scroll: Nature's Withering Wrath Rk. III\nScroll: Gelid Crystals Rk. III, Scroll: Lunassuage Rk. III\nScroll: Mask of the Bosquetender Rk. III, Scroll: Vivification Rk. III\nScroll: Adrenaline Rush Rk. III\nScroll: Stemfang Rush Rk. III (Shadow of Fear)\nEnchanter\nScroll: Mana Reve